    "body": "Yep! This can be handled with an environment variable (`$STARSHIP_CONFIG`).\r\nAs was suggested by @Snuggle in https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/10#issuecomment-484329229, we should use `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`, if available, before resorting to `~/.config`. This was something I was thinking we would address in a future PR.",
